DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Sebastopol Turkey Trot 5K on Thanksgiving morn
 ing! This fun\, family-friendly community race starts and finishes at the 
 Sebastopol Community Center and features a scenic course through Sebastopo
 l and along the West County Trail. Bring the whole family\, get moving bef
 ore the feast\, and help support our community. Proceeds benefit local you
 th through grants and scholarships. A Little Legs 2K is also available for
  younger runners.
