BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Olio Nuovo Harvest and Milling Experience at Gold Ridge Organic Fa
 rms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T141500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T153000
UID:ee65d4ed4d547c750066399f6a2d6fc3@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable behind-the-scenes journey into th
 e heart of our olive harvest season. This experience offers a rare opportu
 nity to see how our award-winning olive oil is crafted\, from the branches
  of our olive trees to the first drops of the season’s oil. Your journey
  begins with a guided tour of our 88-acre organic farm. You’ll step into
  the orchards to watch our expert team harvest fresh olives straight from 
 the trees at their peak of flavor. Next\, you’ll visit our state-of-the-
 art olive oil mill\, where you’ll learn about the milling process and se
 e the olives pressed into vibrant\, fresh Olio Nuovo\, the celebrated “n
 ew oil” prized by culinary enthusiasts for its brilliant green hue and r
 obust\, peppery finish. The highlight comes right at the source: tasting f
 resh Olio Nuovo straight from the mill just moments after the olives are c
 rushed. Book now to secure your spot for this rare\, behind-the-scenes loo
 k at our harvest traditions. Important Notes: *Please wear comfortabl
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/olio-nuovo-harvest-and-
 milling-experience-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms-11-20-2026
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
