BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Festive Wreath Making Class with Flower Casita at Gold Ridge Organ
 ic Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T150000
UID:2e62e16a189ab31d25c75806dc2effc1@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a cozy\, hands-on afternoon celebrating the colors
  and textures of the autumn season at our gorgeous Apple Cottage. We are t
 hrilled to partner with the botanical experts from Flower Casita in Petalu
 ma to guide you through crafting your very own holiday masterpiece. Using 
 an array of fresh seasonal greens\, vibrant autumn leaves\, and rich botan
 ical textures\, you will learn step-by-step techniques to construct a stun
 ning\, festive wreath. Your beautiful creation will be complete and ready 
 to take home—perfectly timed to hang on your door and welcome guests for
  your Thanksgiving festivities! The experience also includes a guided tour
  of our farm aboard our apple trolley. To keep things festive and warm\, y
 ou'll be treated to a slice of freshly baked apple pie and a mug of warm a
 pple cider.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/festive-wreath-making-c
 lass-with-flower-casita-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
