DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T235900
UID:8079b9b76cb55e7726669c79eda47039@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for Food For Thought’s 25th annual fundraiser\, Di
 ning Out For Life on Thursday\, December 3! Dining Out For Life is Sonoma 
 County's largest dine and donate event\, with over 60 participating locati
 ons—ranging from cozy coffee shops to beloved casual and fine dining spo
 ts. Each location is donating a percentage of sales to provide healthy foo
 d and loving support to thousands of our neighbors in need. Plus\, patrons
  and donors have a chance to win one of 9 drawing prizes\, including a 7-n
 ight stay in Mexico and packages from Oliver’s Market\, Glen Ellen Star\
 , Rotten Robbie\, River Electric\, The Junction Beer Garden\, and other lo
 cal restaurants. Dine Out and Take Out on December 3 to Give Back. Find yo
 ur flavor at FFTfoodbank.org/DOFL. Healdsburg Locations: Acre Pizza Baci C
 afé & Wine Bar Drewish Deli Lo & Behold Bar + Kitchen Spoonbar Windsor Lo
 cations: Himalayan Restaurant Machado Burgers Qimura Sushi & Ramen Russian
  River Brewing Company Sweet T’s Restaurant + Bar Umé Japanese Bist
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/dining-out-for-life-12-
 03-2026
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
