DESCRIPTION:A child pleasing holiday circus with aerialists\, jugglers\, a
 crobats\, and comedy\, this show blends classic storybook with celestial m
 agic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages. New Moon
  Circus invites audiences to ‘La Lune Brille’ — memorable family fun
  and stunning artistry under the charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ b
 ig top Meet the Winter moon and her frenemy\, the Sun. When the moon is pu
 shed from the sky\, she must find a way home to the stars. Come along as s
 he encounters mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way. A tiny 
 circus to charm all ages. Show Times Fri\, Nov 27: 5:00 pm (Opening Night 
 ) Sat\, Nov 28: 1:00 pm\, 4:00 pm\, 7:00 pm Sun\, Nov 29: 1:00 pm\, 4:00 p
 m Fri\, Dec 4: 5:00 pm Sat\, Dec 5: 1:00 pm\, 4:00 pm\, 7:00 pm Sun\, Dec 
 6: 1:00 pm\, 4:00 pm Fri\, Dec 11: 5:00 pm Sat\, Dec 12: 1:00 pm\, 4:00 pm
 \, 7:00 pm Sun\, Dec 13: 1:00 pm\, 4:00 pm Fri\, Dec 18: 7:00 pm Sat\, Dec
  19: 1:00 pm\, 4:00 pm\, 7:00 pm Sun\, Dec 20: 1:00 pm\, 4:00 pm\, 7:00 pm
  Tue\, Dec 22: 4:00
