DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T183000
UID:3e699b989fcdbd9c0a29376061a86183@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Close out JCC Sonoma County’s 2026 Jewish Film Festival with
  a warm\, nostalgic look at the Catskills and the beloved Grossinger’s R
 esort and Hotel\, where generations of Jewish families found a place of th
 eir own. Filled with warmth and memories of a vibrant era of Jewish Americ
 an life\, WE MET AT GROSSINGER'S is a film not to be missed.
