BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All My Heart This Night Rejoices: The Old World Carolers in Concer
 t
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T150000
UID:15ec031d81fa06a8fda324e0dd980849@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Since 1985\, Sebastopol’s Old World Carolers has sung for pe
 ace and justice\, green energy\, human rights\, animal shelters\, homeless
  shelters\, shut-ins\, guide dogs\, and many other benefits for the planet
  and the community\, the main benefit being the preservation of rare and b
 eautiful songs in people's homes and lives. We present these songs and car
 ols in a simple way so they can be taken home by listeners and sung around
  the house\, becoming a part of family traditions. History is an important
  part of what we do: learning about cultures through their languages\, tra
 ditions\, and songs. This year the program includes carols from England\, 
 Wales\, France\, Germany\, Spain\, and Denmark. The public is always invit
 ed to sing along\, and song sheets are provided for the entire concert. Th
